@startuml
title Controller-Initiated SCS/MSCS Context

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Northbound caller\n(USP / NBAPI user)" as Caller
actor "WFA-CA UCC" as UCC

rectangle "Controller" {
  component "ODL / on_action" as NBAPI
  component "ServicePrioritizationTask\n- learn notification descriptors\n- validate BSS ownership" as CSP
  component "Controller DB\n- QM descriptors\n- disallow policy\n- QoS settings\n- QMID ownership" as CDB
  component "agent_monitoring_task\n- standard TLV send\n- BSS settings VS send" as AMT
}

rectangle "Standard southbound" {
  component "SERVICE_PRIORITIZATION_REQUEST_MESSAGE\n+ tlvQoSManagementDescriptor" as SPR
  component "MULTI_AP_POLICY_CONFIG_REQUEST_MESSAGE\n+ tlvQoSManagementPolicy" as MAP
  component "QOS_MANAGEMENT_NOTIFICATION_MESSAGE\n+ tlvQoSManagementDescriptor" as QMN
}

rectangle "Vendor-specific settings path" {
  component "cACTION_CONTROL_BSS_SET_\nQOS_MANAGEMENT_REQUEST" as VSCTRL
  component "cACTION_APMANAGER_BSS_SET_\nQOS_MANAGEMENT_REQUEST" as VSAPM
}

rectangle "Agent" {
  component "BackhaulManager\n- WFA-CA dev_set_config\n- per-radio QoS settings send" as BHM
  component "ServicePrioritizationTask\n- parse descriptor TLVs" as ASP
  component "ApAutoConfigurationTask\n- parse policy TLV" as APC
  component "son_slave_thread\n- settings request forward" as SST
  component "AP manager\n- descriptor/policy/settings apply\n- pending fronthaul settings" as APM
  component "ap_wlan_hal_whm" as WHM
}

rectangle "Platform boundary" {
  component "QoS Management\nobject / runtime support" as QOS_MGMT
}

Caller --> NBAPI : SetQMDescriptors()\nSetMSCSDisallowed()\nSetSCSDisallowed()\nSetQoSManagement()
NBAPI --> CDB : validate + persist state
NBAPI --> AMT : trigger CONFIGURE_QOS
UCC --> BHM : dev_set_config(mscs/scs)

AMT --> SPR : targeted per owning agent/BSS
AMT --> MAP : network-wide merged policy
AMT --> VSCTRL : SetQoSManagement BSS settings

SPR --> ASP
MAP --> APC
VSCTRL --> SST
ASP --> QMN : forward learned descriptor
QMN --> CSP
CSP --> CDB : update learned descriptor state
CSP --> AMT : trigger CONFIGURE_QOS

ASP --> APM : ACTION_APMANAGER_QOS_MANAGEMENT_DESCRIPTOR_REQUEST
APC --> APM : ACTION_APMANAGER_QOS_MANAGEMENT_POLICY_REQUEST
BHM --> SST : ACTION_CONTROL_BSS_SET_\nQOS_MANAGEMENT_REQUEST\n(radio scope, zero BSSID)
SST --> VSAPM
VSAPM --> APM
APM --> WHM : backend-specific HAL calls
WHM --> QOS_MGMT : handleQosMgmtDesc()\nSetMscsDisallowStaList()\nSetScsDisallowStaList()\nupdate_object()

note right of AMT
Descriptors and policy use EasyMesh TLVs.
BSS enable settings use the VS path.
end note

note right of CSP
Notification descriptors are learned
with the same Add/Change/Remove parser.
end note

note right of CDB
Controller allocates QMID on Add,
reuses it on Change/Remove, and clears
Remove entries after they are sent.
end note

note right of QOS_MGMT
Current support:
- apply MSCSEnable / SCSEnable
- reject QosMap / DSCP / SCS traffic desc
- test-only disallow-list emulation
- dev_set_config applies per radio
end note

@enduml
